      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini Paulo, mdumi wa Kristo Jesu kwa lukundo lwa Mlungu; namuandikia inyo waeli wa loli wiko andenyi ya Kristo Jesu aho Efeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.19+ACT.18.20+ACT.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 18.19-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.19.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mvono ndeghukaie konyu, na sere rifumagha kwa Mlungu Aba odu, na kwa Bwana Jesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Marasimio gha kiroho andenyi ya Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekaso uo Mlungu, Ndee wa Bwana odu Jesu Kristo, uo oredirasimieghe andenyi ya Kristo na kula irasimio ja kiroho cha mlungunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao oredisaghueghe isi andenyi ya Kristo kufuma aho imbiri wurumwengu ghuseumbilo; eri dikaie dielie, wandu wisewadie ikosa jingi imbiri kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu orebonyere mpango ghwa kusaghulwa kodu kwa lukundo, dipate kukaia wana wake kwa chia ya Jesu Kristo, kunughana na mpango ghwake seji orekundieghe moni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upate kukaswa kwa wundu ghwa mvono ghwake ghwa wubaa, ugho oredinekieghe duu andenyi ya uo Mkundwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andenyi kwake, isi deko na wukomboli ghodu, kwa chia ya bagha yake; kuja kulekelwa makosa ghedu, karakara na wungi ghwa mvono ghwake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wakol. 1.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ugho udinekie kwa wungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Mlungu wadimanyishire iyo ngasu ya lukundo lwake, kwa hikima yose na kumanya, kunughana na mpango ghwake oreghuwikieghe andenyi ya Kristo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukaia, kwa ngelo ikatie, upate kuvikwanya vilambo vose andenyi kwake; ivo viko mlungunyi, na ivo viko andoenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andenyi kwake Kristo, kunughana na ugho mpango ghwa Mlungu, uo uvikatishagha vilambo vose, karakara na njama ya lukundo lwake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isi deresuwirieghe andenyi ya Kristo koimbiri, damerie kusaghulwa na kuwikwa dikaie moyo kwa wundu ghwa kughukasa ugho wubaa ghwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andenyi ya Kristo, inyo wori moresikireghe ilagho ja loli, ijo Ilagho Jiboie ja kukia konyu; nenyo mwendamrumiria, morekabiloghe muhuri kwa Roho Mweli wa ilaghiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao nuo wufunga ghwa ifwa jedu, hata divikie kujiwusa kwa kughukasa ugho wubaa ghwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi ja Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ughu, angu nisikire malagho gha irumirio jenyu andenyi ya Bwana Jesu, na lukundo lonyu kwa waeli wose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "silekagha kufunya chawucha kwa wundu ghonyu; ngimkumbuka andenyi ya malombi ghapo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukaia, uo Mlungu wa Bwana odu Jesu Kristo Aba wa wubaa, umneke inyo Roho ya hikima, na ya mafunuo ghemmanya uo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meso gha ngolo renyu ghineko mwengere, eri mpate kumanya wammbangie kwa isuwirio ja indoki, na ni mali rifwane wada ra ifwa ja wubaa ghwake riko andenyi ya waeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na seji iro ndighi rake risepimikagha ring'ane andenyi kodu isi dirumiriagha, karakara na uko kubonya kazi kwa ndighi rake mbaa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iro orerikatishireghe andenyi ya Kristo, iji oremrukishireghe kufuma kwa wafu, na kumsera kidombo chia ya mkonu ghwake ghwa kiwomi aho mlungunyi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab. 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ighu nandighi kuchumba kubonya nguma kose, na kudima, na ndighi, na wuzuri, na aighu ya kula irina jiwangilo; si kwa ngelo ihi cheni anduangi, ela hata na iyo ichagha wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu waviwikie vilambo vose vikaie maghunyi kwake Kristo, na kummbika ukaie chongo aighu ya vilambo vose kwa wundu ghwa ikanisa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
